"MAP_FOOTER" = "Limits come from OpenStreetMap (the road's maxspeed tag); an untagged segment uses the sign passed or ahead on the same road, and finally the legal default for the road class (built-up area: dual carriageway/one-way 60, other roads 50, expressway 120, living street 20). Roads around the car are downloaded in 1 km cells and kept for 30 days. Overpass servers are small and fast; api.openstreetmap.org is the main server, heavier (1-3 MB per cell) but always there - the app falls back to it when Overpass fails.";
